WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.750 --> 00:00:07.380
[Narrator:] Asian influenza spreads rapidly.

00:00:07.380 --> 00:00:10.710
It can strike you and your entire family at
the same time,

00:00:10.710 --> 00:00:12.330
but it doesn't have to happen

00:00:12.330 --> 00:00:16.200
if you and your family are vaccinated against
Asian influenza.

00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:18.180
Get this protection in time.

00:00:18.180 --> 00:00:21.910
See your doctor or health department now.

00:00:35.680 --> 00:00:40.530
[Narrator:] Vaccination is your only protection
against Asian influenza.

00:00:40.530 --> 00:00:42.710
Be sure you and every member of your family

00:00:42.710 --> 00:00:45.280
have this protection in time.

00:00:45.280 --> 00:00:47.260
Once the disease strikes your community,

00:00:47.260 --> 00:00:49.190
it is too late for vaccination.

00:00:49.190 --> 00:00:52.329
See your doctor or health department now.

00:01:07.040 --> 00:01:08.600
[Narrator:] For the first time in history,

00:01:08.700 --> 00:01:11.460
we are forewarned of a possible epidemic.

00:01:11.460 --> 00:01:14.470
You can help prevent the spread of Asian influenza

00:01:14.470 --> 00:01:16.990
and protect the health of your family

00:01:16.990 --> 00:01:20.040
by vaccination against Asian influenza.

00:01:20.040 --> 00:01:24.240
Don't wait. See your doctor or health department
now.

00:01:41.080 --> 00:01:43.500
[Narrator:] If you need to be on the job every
working day,

00:01:43.500 --> 00:01:46.560
you can't afford any unnecessary illness.

00:01:46.560 --> 00:01:49.680
Asian influenza can make you too sick to work.

00:01:49.680 --> 00:01:51.189
Don't risk it.

00:01:51.189 --> 00:01:54.610
Take the time to be vaccinated against Asian
influenza

00:01:54.610 --> 00:01:56.240
and stay on the job full-time.

